# VS Code REST Client. Secrets come from .env (never paste them here):
#   ADMIN_SECRET=...   (already in .env)
#   TEST_TOKEN=...     (a player token: npx tsx --env-file=.env scripts/dev/get-token.ts; expires after 1 hour)
# Round phases: REVEAL → BETTING → OPENINGS → DEBATE → JUDGING → RESULTS → (next round)   [or CANCELLED]
@base = http://localhost:3000
@token = {{$dotenv TEST_TOKEN}}
@admin = {{$dotenv ADMIN_SECRET}}
# Copy round.id from a state response
@roundId = PASTE_ROUND_ID

### State (projector, no auth) — round.winner / round.verdict stay null until RESULTS
GET {{base}}/api/state

### State (as player) — includes `me` { nickname, tokens, bet, injection }
GET {{base}}/api/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Join (nickname 1-20 chars; re-join keeps tokens)
POST {{base}}/api/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "Lars" }

### Bet — BETTING only, one bet per player per round (second → 409 ALREADY_BET)
POST {{base}}/api/bet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "{{roundId}}", "side": "A", "stake": 20 }

### Inject — body is { roundId, text } only (side = your bet). ONE clue per player per round,
### accepted during OPENINGS and DEBATE, text 1-200 chars.
### Errors: NO_BET, INJECTION_CLOSED, ALREADY_INJECTED, BAD_REQUEST
POST {{base}}/api/inject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "{{roundId}}", "text": "Point out the muddy footprints." }

### Leaderboard
GET {{base}}/api/leaderboard

### ---------------- Admin ----------------

### Reset (fresh game, everyone back to 100)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/reset
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Start round 1 (→ REVEAL)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/start
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Autopilot step — call ~every second; moves phases on their timers and runs one AI call per call.
### Or run: npx tsx --env-file=.env scripts/dev/autopilot.ts
POST {{base}}/api/admin/tick
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}

### Advance by hand — expectedPhase = the phase you think it is now (stale → no change):
### REVEAL | BETTING | OPENINGS | DEBATE | JUDGING | RESULTS | CANCELLED
### OPENINGS needs both openings done and JUDGING needs the verdict (else 409 AI_NOT_DONE).
### DEBATE can be advanced any time (the judge rules on the turns that exist).
POST {{base}}/api/admin/advance
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expectedPhase": "REVEAL" }

### Run next AI step / retry a failed one (one model call: next opening, next turn, or the judge)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/run-ai
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "{{roundId}}", "expectedPhase": "OPENINGS" }

### Cancel + refund every stake (once)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/cancel
x-admin-secret: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roundId": "{{roundId}}" }
